@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000/api
@token = paste-access-token-here

### ============================================================================
### Module M8: Hardening, Performance Benchmarks & Catalog Endpoints
### ============================================================================

### 1. Performance Benchmark: High-Volume Subscriptions Query (< 2s on 3,000 items)
GET {{baseUrl}}/subscriptions?status=active&per_page=15&page=1
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2. Performance Benchmark: High-Volume Invoices Query (< 2s on 8,000 items)
GET {{baseUrl}}/invoices?status=confirmed&per_page=15&page=1
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. Performance Benchmark: Reports & Summary KPI Query (< 2s calculation)
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/summary?date_from=2026-01-01&date_to=2026-12-31
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ============================================================================
### Catalog: Subscription Plans (PLN-01 .. PLN-05)
### ============================================================================

### PLN-01 List Plans (Admin, Staff)
GET {{baseUrl}}/plans?billing_period=monthly&is_active=1&all=1
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### PLN-02 Create Plan (Admin only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/plans
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Enterprise Cloud Monthly",
  "price": 1499.00,
  "billing_period": "monthly",
  "min_quantity": 5,
  "start_date": "2026-01-01",
  "end_date": null,
  "tax_id": 3,
  "auto_close": false,
  "closable": true,
  "pausable": true,
  "renewable": true,
  "is_active": true
}

### PLN-03 Get Single Plan (Admin, Staff)
GET {{baseUrl}}/plans/1
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### PLN-04 Update Plan (Admin only)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/plans/1
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Enterprise Cloud Monthly - Updated",
  "price": 1599.00,
  "billing_period": "monthly",
  "min_quantity": 5,
  "start_date": "2026-01-01",
  "end_date": null,
  "tax_id": 3,
  "auto_close": false,
  "closable": true,
  "pausable": true,
  "renewable": true,
  "is_active": true
}

### PLN-05 Delete Plan (Admin only, 409 if active subscription exists)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/plans/999
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ============================================================================
### Catalog: Promotional Discounts (DSC-01 .. DSC-05)
### ============================================================================

### DSC-01 List Discounts (Admin, Staff)
GET {{baseUrl}}/discounts?state=active&type=percentage&all=1
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### DSC-02 Create Discount (Admin only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/discounts
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Demo Loyalty 15% Off",
  "code": "LOYALTY15",
  "type": "percentage",
  "value": 15.00,
  "applies_to": "subscription",
  "product_ids": [],
  "min_purchase": 500.00,
  "min_quantity": null,
  "start_date": "2026-01-01",
  "end_date": "2027-12-31",
  "usage_limit": 100,
  "is_active": true
}

### DSC-03 Get Single Discount (Admin, Staff)
GET {{baseUrl}}/discounts/1
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### DSC-04 Update Discount (Admin only, usage_limit >= used_count)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/discounts/1
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Demo Loyalty 15% Off - Extended",
  "code": "LOYALTY15",
  "type": "percentage",
  "value": 15.00,
  "applies_to": "subscription",
  "product_ids": [],
  "min_purchase": 500.00,
  "min_quantity": null,
  "start_date": "2026-01-01",
  "end_date": "2028-12-31",
  "usage_limit": 200,
  "is_active": true
}

### DSC-05 Delete Discount (Admin only)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/discounts/999
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
